# Keep the build context small and free of secrets: images install their own dependencies on Linux.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.claude
.serena
.playwright-mcp
.lighthouseci
docs
deploy/backups
apps/api/src/generated
*.png
!apps/web/public/**/*.png
**/.media
**/.private-files
